WEBVTT

00:27:28.809 --> 00:27:31.176
a distant coworker or even a stranger,

00:27:31.200 --> 00:27:34.031
as long as the interaction
leaves you feeling seen.

00:27:34.870 --> 00:27:39.468
JD: You know, 40 seconds of interaction,
a positive caring interaction,

00:27:39.492 --> 00:27:42.626
has measurable impacts on both.

00:27:42.650 --> 00:27:44.946
Both people -- 40 seconds.

00:27:44.970 --> 00:27:46.526
Forty seconds!

00:27:46.550 --> 00:27:49.814
AG: Jane and her collaborators find
that in high-quality connections,

00:27:49.838 --> 00:27:51.923
we aren't just more
energized and effective.

00:27:51.947 --> 00:27:53.899
We also learn and grow more.

00:27:53.923 --> 00:27:57.636
Fortunately, there are possibilities
for high-quality connections everywhere.

00:27:57.660 --> 00:27:59.610
Jane looks for these in her daily life.